<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan bolivar holds steady against dollar.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan bolivar holds steady against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed unchanged at 477/478 per dollar Monday, in quieter trade, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market has been quieter than in recent days,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>After a topsy-turvy week in which the bolivar slipped as low as 492 bolivars per dollar, traders said the market had stabilized and did not expect large movements in coming sessions.</p>
<p>((-- Oscar Galvis, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)</p>
</text>
